    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d87">

                <pb facs="0161" n="101" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg101"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr.
                            Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-08-09"><hi rendition="#italic">August 9, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received Sept. 23.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2303.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose a translation
                    of a commutation from the Tsung-li Yamên, relating to the recent riots at Kutien
                    in the Province of Fuhkien. It will be seen that the Yamên has ordered the
                    arrest and punishment of the murderers, and that protection be insured to
                    foreigners.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Denby</hi></signed>.</closer>


                <xi:include href="d87-a1.xml" xpointer="d87-a1"/>
            </div>
